WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.280
<i>The Stranger at the Threshold — Scene three. The Stranger at the Threshold.</i>

2
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:18.660
<v Narrator><i>Wearing the shape of Mentes, Athena waits at the palace threshold with her spear upright.</i>

3
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:28.160
<v Narrator><i>Dice strike the floor; cups are filled; the suitors never look toward the gate.</i>

4
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:38.780
<v Narrator><i>Telemachus sees the unattended stranger and crosses the hall, ashamed of his own house.</i>

5
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:52.583
<v Telemachus>Welcome, stranger. You are kindly come to our house; give me your spear. Eat first, and afterward tell me what you need, but come, away from this noise.
